t.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-ft","agent_clan_generation":"20261102063000","bead_id":"bob-cli-ft.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-ft[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Blocked-reason marks — every [?] checkbox says why[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]In Obsidian, a Blocked task's checkbox shows why it is blocked. It [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]shows & for its own open prerequisite, ^ for a blocked project, 1–4[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]for a P1–P4 priority deferral, ⟲ for a recurring rule's next run, ?[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]for a date picked by hand, and a dashed ? when no reason is left. [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Solid boxes mean held by other work, hollow boxes mean waiting for [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]a date. Stored Markdown, reconcile, and the Tasks registry stay [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]exactly as they are.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]8[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]7[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]blocked_reason_marks.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/blocked_reason_marks.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-ft[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-ft/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Blocked-marks display contract and decision record (bob-cli)[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract: write bob-cli docs/blocked-marks.md (marks, precedence, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]families and tones, tooltip copy, surfaces, reliability rules, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]api.blockMarks v1, BM vectors), amend the priority-marks eligibility and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]vectors in docs/projects.md, cross-link the sibling contracts, register [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the page, and add the accepted decision record.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pure block-mark model and api.blockMarks.model [/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF](bob-ledger-tools)[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]model[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]model: add the pure classifier fragment, the memo-local [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]open-prerequisite index, the plugin method that feeds it live line text,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the ladder, and today, and api.blockMarks v1 model(); node tests run [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]every BM vector verbatim. No visible change.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Checkbox rendering in Live Preview and reading view, CSS, [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]toggle, tooltips[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]editor_marks[dim] · [dim][/dim]after model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]editor_marks: render the marks on Blocked checkboxes in Live Preview, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reading view, embeds, hover previews, and Dataview TASK views. Covers [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the gated CSS families and tokens, glyph masks and the corner pip, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]session toggle, hover tooltips, invalidation, api.blockMarks.render, a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]contrast test, and a real-Obsidian e2e harness with light and dark [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]screenshots.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Fold the priority bars on digit rows and the project tag on ^ [bold black on #87D7FF][/bold #D7AFFF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]rows[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]redundancy_folds[dim] · [dim][/dim]after editor_marks[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]redundancy_folds: where the checkbox digit already says the priority, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fold the signal bars. Where the ^ mark already says the project is [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]blocked, fold the #prj_is_blocked pill. Applies in Live Preview and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reading view, keeps cursor reveal, and is gated on both toggles.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Block marks in Tasks query results (CSS-only)[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tasks_results[dim] · [dim][/dim]after redundancy_folds[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tasks_results: draw the marks on Tasks query result rows from Tasks' own[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]row attributes, with no JS on Tasks DOM. Also hide the priority glyph on[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]digit rows and the project tag on ^ rows. Verify the Tasks 8.4.0 [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]attributes in the e2e harness.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Block marks inside DEPENDS ON and BLOCKS chips[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]chips[dim] · [dim][/dim]after tasks_results[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chips: a Blocked prerequisite or dependent chip draws its own miniature [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]block mark and reason, exposing whether the critical path is waiting on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]work or on a date.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Task Card reason header and teaching digit [/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF](bob-navigation-hotkeys)[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]task_card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after editor_marks[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]task_card: the Task Card's BLOCKED lane chip becomes the block mark plus[/